WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.260
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:29.530 --> 00:31.017
Hello?

3
00:31.697 --> 00:33.349
Hello.

4
00:34.790 --> 00:36.443
Did you get home?

5
00:37.055 --> 00:38.303
Yeah.

6
00:39.241 --> 00:41.451
I just got in.

7
00:45.552 --> 00:46.886
Welcome home.

8
00:50.623 --> 00:52.383
Thank you.

9
00:56.299 --> 00:57.597
Well...

10
00:59.738 --> 01:03.831
It's kind of hard to come up with stuff to say.

11
01:04.488 --> 01:06.329
Oh, that's true.

12
01:06.329 --> 01:09.941
Maybe I can think of a funny story.

13
01:09.941 --> 01:11.888
That's not what I mean.

14
01:15.246 --> 01:17.718
I get nervous around my girlfriend.

15
01:21.299 --> 01:23.046
Girlfriend?

16
01:25.165 --> 01:26.965
That's you, right?

17
01:33.213 --> 01:34.433
Yeah.

18
01:44.888 --> 01:45.900
Morning.

19
01:45.900 --> 01:47.540
Morning.

20
02:03.423 --> 02:05.029
Nagi.

21
02:06.462 --> 02:07.689
What?

22
02:09.838 --> 02:14.235
Yesterday, Taguchi and I...

23
02:17.850 --> 02:20.307
We started dating.

24
02:24.770 --> 02:31.024
I was able to properly put a name to my feelings.

25
02:34.029 --> 02:35.609
I see.

26
02:40.369 --> 02:41.937
Nagi?

27
02:43.872 --> 02:47.630
I've always been so worried about you.

28
02:48.354 --> 02:51.378
I see, that's great.

29
02:52.884 --> 02:55.039
Leave the wedding to me.

30
02:55.039 --> 02:58.051
I'll do your hair and makeup. Want multiple outfits?

31
02:58.051 --> 03:02.002
Wait, it's too soon to talk about marriage.

32
03:02.002 --> 03:04.195
I see. An office romance, huh?

33
03:04.978 --> 03:07.031
That's nice.

34
03:08.699 --> 03:11.123
An office romance...

35
03:52.031 --> 03:55.529
[Should we act as we usually do at work?]

36
04:00.903 --> 04:03.790
I wanted to ask for final confirmation on this UI image.

37
04:03.790 --> 04:05.029
Sure.

38
04:08.670 --> 04:10.096
Taguchi.

39
04:10.096 --> 04:11.710
Good morning!

40
04:12.528 --> 04:14.307
Good morning.

41
04:14.307 --> 04:16.048
Sorry, Mr. Taguchi.

42
04:16.048 --> 04:18.292
No, I'm sorry, Ms. Yamane.

43
04:27.590 --> 04:28.937
Morning.

44
04:28.937 --> 04:30.931
Good morning.

45
04:33.517 --> 04:35.017
The date.

46
04:36.643 --> 04:38.363
How did it go?

47
04:49.131 --> 04:51.849
I have something to report.

48
04:54.437 --> 04:57.471
We've started dating.

49
04:57.471 --> 05:00.278
Huh? What?

50
05:01.566 --> 05:02.906
Yes.

51
05:03.795 --> 05:07.711
You were able to figure out your own feelings.

52
05:08.678 --> 05:10.692
You did great.

53
05:10.692 --> 05:13.878
It's really thanks to you, Ms. Ohata.

54
05:13.878 --> 05:17.593
All I did was lend you an ear.

55
05:17.593 --> 05:22.681
The one who listened to my struggles was you, Ms. Ohata.

56
05:23.840 --> 05:26.858
If I had kept worrying about it alone,

57
05:26.858 --> 05:30.596
I don't know if I could've found an answer.

58
05:32.502 --> 05:37.697
I'm really glad you were there, Ms. Ohata.

59
05:40.718 --> 05:45.565
And so, I want to thank you somehow.

60
05:48.307 --> 05:52.470
Then, I have a request.

61
05:53.280 --> 05:54.553
Okay.

62
05:59.622 --> 06:02.612
Tell me all about your romance.

63
06:03.245 --> 06:07.197
Huh? Is that really a way to thank you?

64
06:07.197 --> 06:09.357
Yeah. Of course.

65
06:14.418 --> 06:17.097
Ms. Ohata, you smiled!

66
06:20.205 --> 06:21.995
You promised, okay?

67
06:23.884 --> 06:25.144
Yes.

68
06:39.678 --> 06:41.802
Are you kind of tired?

69
06:41.802 --> 06:45.142
Yeah, a little.

70
06:46.323 --> 06:50.465
Oh, you couldn't focus on work?

71
06:51.718 --> 06:54.706
No, well... that's...

72
06:58.542 --> 07:00.455
I couldn't focus either, you know?

73
07:12.933 --> 07:17.885
This morning, I told Ms. Ohata about us.

74
07:17.885 --> 07:20.544
She's been giving me a lot of advice.

75
07:21.195 --> 07:23.247
I see.

76
07:23.247 --> 07:24.408
Yeah.

77
07:25.555 --> 07:27.792
Did Ms. Ohata say anything?

78
07:29.004 --> 07:31.130
She said I did great.

79
07:31.130 --> 07:36.293
And that she wants to hear about our romance.

80
07:36.293 --> 07:38.078
Our romance?

81
07:38.078 --> 07:39.597
Yeah.

82
07:39.597 --> 07:42.951
Well, I want to hear about that too.

83
07:42.951 --> 07:44.204
Huh?

84
07:49.780 --> 07:51.312
Hey, can't think of anything?

85
07:51.312 --> 07:54.365
No, that's not it.

86
07:54.365 --> 07:59.108
Once I start talking, I won't be able to stop.

87
08:03.793 --> 08:08.337
Sorry for saying weird things. It's just, my heart's been...

88
08:12.826 --> 08:14.227
I see.

89
08:20.083 --> 08:21.711
But...

90
08:23.605 --> 08:27.034
I'm filled with happiness.

91
08:33.638 --> 08:37.725
I'm really glad that I realized

92
08:40.057 --> 08:44.000
that I like you, Taguchi.

93
09:13.918 --> 09:15.688
- You said something like that? - Yeah.

94
09:15.688 --> 09:17.699
- You didn't know? - I had no idea.

95
09:39.706 --> 09:41.619
Should we get going soon?

96
09:43.640 --> 09:44.808
Huh?

97
09:47.694 --> 09:49.937
Taguchi.

98
09:49.937 --> 09:51.911
We're at work.

99
09:52.551 --> 09:53.637
Yeah.

100
09:55.003 --> 09:56.542
I know.

101
09:58.506 --> 10:00.416
I know, but...

102
10:24.333 --> 10:25.746
Why?

103
10:28.795 --> 10:30.909
Because we're at work.

104
10:33.065 --> 10:34.545
Is that all?

105
10:37.836 --> 10:44.315
I won't be able to go back in with a normal face, so we can't.

106
10:48.607 --> 10:51.427
Maybe next time...

107
11:04.791 --> 11:07.279
Remember, you said "next time".

108
11:21.640 --> 11:25.846
Hey, next time, can I introduce you to my friend?

109
11:26.833 --> 11:28.277
Your friend?

110
11:28.277 --> 11:31.641
Yeah. The guy I was closest to in college.

111
11:31.641 --> 11:34.116
I've told him about you.

112
11:35.004 --> 11:38.332
What did you tell him about me?

113
11:43.275 --> 11:44.756
I forgot.

114
11:47.623 --> 11:51.221
But when I said we're dating, he said he wants to meet you.

115
11:54.237 --> 11:56.927
Oh, it's okay if you say no.

116
11:58.890 --> 12:01.737
Sure, I want to meet him too.

117
12:03.432 --> 12:05.093
I'm Inooka.

118
12:07.324 --> 12:09.237
I'm Taiki Inooka.

119
12:11.189 --> 12:13.239
I'm Shiori Yamane.

120
12:13.239 --> 12:15.052
Nice to meet you today.

121
12:17.527 --> 12:19.135
What's with that reaction?

122
12:19.135 --> 12:21.434
Huh? Well...

123
12:22.319 --> 12:24.735
She talks in her sleep?

124
12:26.813 --> 12:28.130
Don't say stupid things.

125
12:28.130 --> 12:30.450
It's not stupid.

126
12:31.736 --> 12:34.213
I'm looking forward to this.

127
12:36.898 --> 12:41.308
We're gonna have a good, long talk today.

128
12:47.937 --> 12:50.130
Oh, man!

129
12:50.130 --> 12:53.461
Seriously, I'm so happy to meet you.

130
12:55.149 --> 12:59.388
This guy has a super low tolerance. Look, he's barely had any.

131
12:59.388 --> 13:01.367
No, no, this is normal.

132
13:01.367 --> 13:04.222
You don't usually drink.

133
13:04.222 --> 13:07.479
Well, it's a happy occasion, so once in a while is fine.

134
13:07.479 --> 13:09.770
- And I'm a little nervous too. - Nervous?

135
13:09.770 --> 13:14.510
I mean, this is the Yamane, the one who finally snagged Ryosuke.

136
13:14.510 --> 13:16.696
- "The Yamane"? - Just drink some water.

137
13:16.696 --> 13:18.224
Why do I have to drink that?

138
13:18.224 --> 13:21.080
Just drink it. You're drunk.

139
13:22.352 --> 13:24.722
You two really are close.

140
13:24.722 --> 13:27.057
Well, being with this guy is easy.

141
13:27.057 --> 13:30.515
What do you mean "easy"? I've done so much for you.

142
13:30.515 --> 13:33.785
Yeah, and I've done the same for you too.

143
13:33.785 --> 13:35.588
That's right.

144
13:35.588 --> 13:37.589
Oh, I know!

145
13:37.589 --> 13:40.444
Want to see some college photos?

146
13:40.444 --> 13:41.985
Oh?

147
13:41.985 --> 13:45.285
No, that's fine. She doesn't need to see.

148
13:45.285 --> 13:48.473
Wait, photos of you in college?

149
13:53.121 --> 13:55.307
Just show her.

150
14:01.219 --> 14:04.471
You look kind of young.

151
14:09.372 --> 14:12.226
But your hair was already black.

152
14:12.226 --> 14:14.150
Yeah.

153
14:14.150 --> 14:18.197
I think that's from our fourth year of college.

154
14:18.197 --> 14:22.495
I think it was around when we got assigned to our labs.

155
14:22.495 --> 14:23.730
Oh, that's right!

156
14:23.730 --> 14:25.347
During our labs' group trip, he...

157
14:25.347 --> 14:27.325
Stop! Don't say stupid stuff!

158
14:27.325 --> 14:29.077
- Why not? - You don't have to say it!

159
14:29.077 --> 14:31.257
It's okay if she knows.

160
14:32.489 --> 14:34.580
Sorry, it's work. I'll be right back.

161
14:34.580 --> 14:35.800
Okay.

162
14:38.595 --> 14:41.237
- Take your time. - Don't say anything stupid.

163
14:41.237 --> 14:42.782
So scary.

164
14:43.793 --> 14:45.343
Thank you for that.

165
14:45.343 --> 14:46.929
Sure.

166
14:54.092 --> 14:55.659
Hey.

167
14:57.129 --> 15:01.860
When I called you "the Yamane", I didn't mean anything weird by it.

168
15:01.860 --> 15:03.627
Huh?

169
15:03.627 --> 15:07.709
Back when we were students, I just happened to hear about you.

170
15:08.641 --> 15:12.118
Ryosuke is good with people,

171
15:12.796 --> 15:16.613
but he doesn't really get close to anyone.

172
15:17.486 --> 15:21.618
He wasn't the type to get attached to anyone.

173
15:22.765 --> 15:24.151
But...

174
15:26.784 --> 15:29.574
I'm glad you're a good person.

175
15:30.638 --> 15:33.020
That's... I'm flattered.

176
15:33.020 --> 15:36.864
It's my first time seeing Ryosuke in such a good mood.

177
15:37.512 --> 15:39.065
Was he in a good mood?

178
15:39.065 --> 15:41.399
You couldn't tell?

179
15:41.399 --> 15:42.693
No...

180
15:43.519 --> 15:46.852
Then he's always like that in front of you, huh?

181
15:51.910 --> 15:54.850
But this is my first time

182
15:55.972 --> 15:58.712
seeing him look so relaxed.

183
15:59.892 --> 16:03.331
Well, we get along.

184
16:03.331 --> 16:06.807
He said you were his best friend in college,

185
16:06.807 --> 16:12.837
so I knew you must be a very important friend to him.

186
16:16.776 --> 16:19.351
Huh? Why are you laughing?

187
16:23.150 --> 16:25.974
He really loves us, huh?

188
16:29.804 --> 16:31.411
I guess so.

189
16:32.696 --> 16:34.327
Cheers!

190
16:34.327 --> 16:35.871
Cheers.

191
16:38.549 --> 16:41.011
Remember your last client?

192
16:41.011 --> 16:43.077
Yes, I remember.

193
16:43.077 --> 16:46.169
We're trying to start another project there.

194
16:46.169 --> 16:48.409
We want you to come, Taguchi.

195
16:49.149 --> 16:50.574
Huh?

196
16:50.574 --> 16:53.287
Well, it's not decided yet, though.

197
17:15.553 --> 17:17.182
I see.

198
17:17.779 --> 17:20.946
So it tastes good because I'm eating with you.

199
17:48.901 --> 17:50.608
Oh, you're here.

200
17:53.135 --> 17:54.754
- Ryosuke. - Yeah?

201
17:54.754 --> 17:57.798
Looks like they're moving me to Fukuoka.

202
17:57.798 --> 18:01.110
We'll have to move right away, so be ready.

203
18:04.488 --> 18:05.761
Huh?

204
18:11.495 --> 18:13.775
I'm glad

205
18:13.775 --> 18:15.917
that you get to date Yamane.

206
18:18.475 --> 18:19.788
Yeah.

207
18:21.217 --> 18:24.550
But hey, did you tell her the truth?

208
18:24.550 --> 18:29.271
Like why you said that to Yamane before you transferred schools.

209
18:32.529 --> 18:34.110
I didn't.

210
18:34.880 --> 18:37.054
I didn't tell her

211
18:38.772 --> 18:40.982
and I don't want to.

212
18:40.982 --> 18:42.302
Huh?

213
18:46.072 --> 18:48.619
Because I don't want to trouble her.

214
18:56.200 --> 18:58.364
Are you okay now?

215
18:58.364 --> 18:59.612
Yeah.

216
19:00.511 --> 19:04.316
But I'm sorry... both you and Inooka.

217
19:04.316 --> 19:08.297
No, he didn't seem to mind at all.

218
19:08.297 --> 19:12.659
Well, I'm going to hold off on alcohol for a while.

219
19:12.659 --> 19:14.074
I see.

220
19:18.371 --> 19:20.316
Thanks for walking me home.

221
19:20.316 --> 19:23.840
Of course. I just wanted to be with you a little longer.

222
19:29.524 --> 19:35.753
It was really fun hearing more about you today, Taguchi.

223
19:37.066 --> 19:40.530
Inooka is a really good person, too.

224
19:44.866 --> 19:46.286
What's wrong?

225
19:49.120 --> 19:52.179
You two are so close.

226
19:52.179 --> 19:55.070
I got a little jealous.

227
19:55.070 --> 19:57.923
Huh? Even though we're dating?

228
19:59.116 --> 20:03.566
I realized there's still so much I don't know about you.

229
20:07.795 --> 20:10.177
Well, that goes both ways.

230
20:11.081 --> 20:12.403
Yeah.

231
20:15.214 --> 20:20.262
So, I want to know more about you, Taguchi.

232
20:23.781 --> 20:25.947
I feel the same way.

233
20:29.925 --> 20:31.686
Thank goodness.

234
20:33.678 --> 20:35.889
Well, see you tomorrow.

235
20:35.889 --> 20:38.755
Yeah. See you tomorrow.

236
20:51.362 --> 20:53.107
Hey...

237
20:53.107 --> 20:57.942
There was one more thing I was jealous about.

238
20:58.588 --> 20:59.901
Yeah?

239
21:05.413 --> 21:07.318
Good night,

240
21:08.143 --> 21:10.409
Ryosuke.

241
21:20.902 --> 21:23.794
Huh? Hey, wait a minute!

242
21:35.003 --> 21:37.312
She got me.

243
21:42.962 --> 21:45.777
Good morning, Ms. Yamane.

244
21:46.682 --> 21:48.673
Good morning.

245
21:50.551 --> 21:52.386
What was that yesterday?

246
21:57.164 --> 21:59.950
You wanted me to go easy on you, right?

247
22:05.295 --> 22:08.188
But if you do stuff like that...

248
22:11.456 --> 22:13.143
Well...

249
22:19.673 --> 22:21.668
Hey, when is "next time"?

250
22:33.642 --> 22:35.706
What are you doing?

251
22:35.706 --> 22:37.923
I bought the wrong one.

252
22:38.679 --> 22:40.253
Are you feeling tired?

253
22:40.985 --> 22:42.837
Maybe I'm just mentally exhausted.

254
22:42.837 --> 22:45.419
You know, with school festival prep.

255
22:45.419 --> 22:46.859
I see.

256
22:47.505 --> 22:52.204
But talking with you is really fun.

257
23:01.371 --> 23:02.885
Hey.

258
23:05.191 --> 23:06.878
Actually, I...

259
23:10.516 --> 23:12.029
Yamane!

260
23:15.395 --> 23:18.128
Is that you, Yamane?

261
23:21.767 --> 23:23.661
Kashiwagi?

262
23:30.645 --> 23:33.621
Kashiwagi, you haven't changed at all.

263
23:33.621 --> 23:36.505
Yamane, you've become really beautiful.

264
23:36.505 --> 23:38.940
The two of them had a great vibe.

265
23:38.940 --> 23:41.973
I lied to her for the second time.

266
23:41.973 --> 23:43.098
Did you two meet?

267
23:43.098 --> 23:44.339
We haven't met.

268
23:44.339 --> 23:47.574
I feel like Taguchi has been down lately.

269
23:47.574 --> 23:50.911
I wonder what I can do to be more like a girlfriend.

270
23:50.911 --> 23:53.256
A date at home.

271
23:53.256 --> 23:55.298
I don't want to let you go home.

272
23:55.298 --> 24:00.031
I want to do couple-like things with you, too, Ryosuke.
